# BUGS

There are no apps or scripting.
A request a process had sent when its mounted service ended is sent once more, to the new instance, so a write may be done twice.
A pushed program runs only as a service: rc's `/bin` stays bootfs's, and a pushed build is on fs(4)'s RAM disk, gone at a reboot.
